{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113699546211463168"]}, "author_id": "19355829", "created_at": "2026-10-23T18:30:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113699557020217528"], "id": "2113699557020217528", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 5403, "like_count": 48, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "Back from France, catching up on analysis. The object  found in Borneo on Oct 19 is indeed likely to be from the upper stage of  ZQ-2E Y4, launched on Oct 14 and reentered on Oct 18. The ground track  (using the final Space-Track TLE) passed near the debris site at 1036  UTC Oct https://t.co/Qf4DI8PNX3", "url": "https://x.com/planet4589/status/2113699557020217528"}, {"author_id": "11348282", "created_at": "2026-10-23T18:05:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113693409772761305"], "id": "2113693409772761305", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 67, "impression_count": 323888, "like_count": 1053, "quote_count": 32, "reply_count": 93, "retweet_count": 237}, "text": "LIVE: @NASAAdmin and agency leaders are sharing the latest updates on next year's Artemis III mission and our plans to return astronauts to the surface of the Moon by 2028. https://t.co/G1ya48yeun", "url": "https://x.com/NASA/status/2113693409772761305"}, {"author_id": "17217640", "created_at": "2026-10-23T17:39:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113686734722711770"], "id": "2113686734722711770", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 17, "impression_count": 17610, "like_count": 70, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 10}, "text": "Beginning at 2 pm ET, NASA Administrator Jared Isaacman, Associate Admin. Amit Kshatriya, and Artemis Program Manager Jeremy Parsons will provide an update on the progress towards Artemis 3 and the status of work towards Artemis 4 and beyond.\n\nWatch live: https://t.co/WX0vWTtN7T", "url": "https://x.com/SpaceflightNow/status/2113686734722711770"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-23T16:11:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113664736805941726"], "id": "2113664736805941726", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1082, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113338138953441414", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Join me in Ann Arbor TONIGHT to talk about the end of the age of man and the rise of the machine https://t.co/cgCvI2uAam", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2113664736805941726"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-23T16:09:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113664212664979642"], "id": "2113664212664979642", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 3334, "like_count": 45, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113650168385909197", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "So actually in a weird way it kinda makes sense because Iran is a leader in sex change work.\n\nTrans identity doesn’t have to code liberal! It can also code as “it’s impossible to ACTUALLY be gay, we will just change your parts instead” https://t.co/HlztTg5lLY", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2113664212664979642"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113655285982089216"]}, "author_id": "11348282", "created_at": "2026-10-23T15:34:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113655288687431819"], "id": "2113655288687431819", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 189, "impression_count": 338336, "like_count": 3133, "quote_count": 50, "reply_count": 138, "retweet_count": 534}, "text": "Ahh… blue lagoon 🏖️\n\nThis deep-blue sea of gas and dust—called Messier 8 or the Lagoon Nebula—is a hotbed of star formation. The young stars within the nebula emit rays of high-energy light, including X-rays shown in pink by @chandraxray. https://t.co/lhTssGyI5i", "url": "https://x.com/NASA/status/2113655288687431819"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-23T14:27:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113638535505006918"], "id": "2113638535505006918", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 1647, "like_count": 38, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113299708240396539", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "New fantasy map just dropped https://t.co/3EGxlrMu1F", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2113638535505006918"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-23T14:20:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113636718952042502"], "id": "2113636718952042502", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 2373, "like_count": 47, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113504303117688930", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Who can make this real????\n\nI’d buy it in a heartbeat https://t.co/lk7qsWub0G", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2113636718952042502"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-23T14:18:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113636275018244150"], "id": "2113636275018244150", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1571, "like_count": 18, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113618146393260292", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This bothers me less than old-age carveouts because veterans who maintain taxable property after their service are overwhelmingly contributing citizens who have made under compensated contributions to their country. https://t.co/zEnxfFM46M", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2113636275018244150"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-23T13:53:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113629787801473076"], "id": "2113629787801473076", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 802, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113338138953441414", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "TONIGHT! https://t.co/cgCvI2uAam", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2113629787801473076"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-23T13:47:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113628290271326272"], "id": "2113628290271326272", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1286, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113469298144661829", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Because Texans shoot back https://t.co/NhQIDJsmjT", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2113628290271326272"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-23T13:39:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113626446337843539"], "id": "2113626446337843539", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 5801, "like_count": 149, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 12}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113347152021991735", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Unfortunately two big differences:\n1) the cars got bigger and the drivers got stupider\n2) the laws got way less tolerant of independent kids\n\nDrivers and officials. Your top enemies as a parent. https://t.co/Jg1ZsLJC8t", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2113626446337843539"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-23T13:18:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113621169853378564"], "id": "2113621169853378564", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 7332, "like_count": 45, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113442771902054701", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Tbh yes https://t.co/Ga8wGq7147", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2113621169853378564"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-23T13:14:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113620087043477978"], "id": "2113620087043477978", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 3168, "like_count": 74, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113347967872811131", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Harry Potter is indeed literally a Christian wizard https://t.co/sGbKEWQ3c7", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2113620087043477978"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-23T13:12:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113619483340235069"], "id": "2113619483340235069", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1956, "like_count": 47, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113602912702369911", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "The correct way to celebrate Halloween is to dress up as Martin Luther and yell Reformation slogans and anti-Papal invective at passers-by because ITS REFORMATION DAY.\n\nI’m a wonderful neighbor https://t.co/EyyMVGZX0f", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2113619483340235069"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-23T13:04:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113617683745034404"], "id": "2113617683745034404", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 885, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113121331541897629", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Did they test to see if Fable can recover hidden messages from images that do NOT have anything hidden in them? https://t.co/FTejRcVwtF", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2113617683745034404"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-23T13:02:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113616980724830548"], "id": "2113616980724830548", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 21, "impression_count": 28576, "like_count": 201, "quote_count": 8, "reply_count": 80, "retweet_count": 16}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113596544997802429", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Given that several of these ethnicities are high income and highly educated I think it’s worth asking more “how did we manage to alienate these people” instead of “how can we even be more a white ethnic party.” https://t.co/zNs4U1BKo6", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2113616980724830548"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113612399911555072"]}, "author_id": "21436960", "created_at": "2026-10-23T12:46:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113613024573509711"], "id": "2113613024573509711", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 42, "impression_count": 20330, "like_count": 482, "quote_count": 8, "reply_count": 13, "retweet_count": 79}, "text": "Europe is building its own capability to reach, land and operate on the Moon. \n\nBringing together expertise from across Europe, Argonaut will deliver cargo and technology to the lunar surface, starting with its first mission from 2030.\n\n🔗https://t.co/ldvWfeeCY6 https://t.co/5eRamxs1uh", "url": "https://x.com/esa/status/2113613024573509711"}, {"author_id": "21436960", "created_at": "2026-10-23T11:40:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113596501981282396"], "id": "2113596501981282396", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 12570, "like_count": 195, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 17, "retweet_count": 25}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113555971263905919", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Another successful step on Hera’s approach to Didymos and Dimorphos. 🎯 https://t.co/ggsQDJjkao", "url": "https://x.com/esa/status/2113596501981282396"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113588424984719360"]}, "author_id": "610659001", "created_at": "2026-10-23T11:09:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113588610851283120"], "id": "2113588610851283120", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 14, "impression_count": 11113, "like_count": 107, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "Right now I'm working on this timeline of wars over the last two centuries. https://t.co/53kuZwZ6YM", "url": "https://x.com/MaxCRoser/status/2113588610851283120"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-23T02:28:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113457394500190560"], "id": "2113457394500190560", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 41, "impression_count": 55231, "like_count": 429, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 17}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113431596309389555", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I fully believe this message polls well\n\nBecause abortion has always been a eugenics program https://t.co/hHRDSfEFcW", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2113457394500190560"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113434784022011904"]}, "author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-23T00:59:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113435104299159735"], "id": "2113435104299159735", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 18, "impression_count": 29996, "like_count": 131, "quote_count": 7, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 11}, "text": "it's just wild to me that age-controlled fertility within marital durations is actually rising in the U.S, and by a lot!\n\nfertility at 15-19 years marital duration for women aged 30-39 has risen ***50%*** since 2008-10!\n\nbut marriage rates have cratered https://t.co/ME4ngfoTM9", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2113435104299159735"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113403162379902977"]}, "author_id": "17217640", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:56:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113404155591303452"], "id": "2113404155591303452", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 10679, "like_count": 133, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 23}, "text": "SpaceX scrubbed its launch attempt of the Starlink 15-15 mission for a third day in a row. This time, teams got through the fueling process and called off a launch attempt in the final minute. The scrub was called today due to poor weather at the launch pad. https://t.co/hRO8QeAnTD", "url": "https://x.com/SpaceflightNow/status/2113404155591303452"}, {"author_id": "34743251", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:40:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113400239017378069"], "id": "2113400239017378069", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 611, "impression_count": 1242833, "like_count": 10014, "quote_count": 130, "reply_count": 554, "retweet_count": 1341}, "text": "Watch Falcon 9 launch 27 @Starlink satellites to orbit from California https://t.co/7PhslAU5ac", "url": "https://x.com/SpaceX/status/2113400239017378069"}, {"author_id": "17217640", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:17:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113394335165366734"], "id": "2113394335165366734", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9083, "like_count": 36, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "While the range is currently red for weather, SpaceX is proceeding with fueling its Falcon 9 rocket at Vandenberg Space Force Base. Liftoff of the Starlink 15-15 mission is set for 3:51 p.m. PDT (6:51 p.m. EDT / 2251 UTC).\n\nWatch live: https://t.co/oIrnYAsCWg", "url": "https://x.com/SpaceflightNow/status/2113394335165366734"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2113699546211463168", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2113655285982089216", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2113612399911555072", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2113588424984719360", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2113434784022011904", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2113403162379902977", "type": "photo"}], "users": [{"id": "19355829", "name": "Jonathan McDowell", "username": "planet4589"}, {"id": "11348282", "name": "NASA", "username": "NASA"}, {"id": "17217640", "name": "Spaceflight Now", "username": "SpaceflightNow"}, {"id": "626660983", "name": "Lyman Stone 石來民 🦬🦬🦬", "username": "lymanstoneky"}, {"id": "21436960", "name": "European Space Agency", "username": "esa"}, {"id": "610659001", "name": "Max Roser", "username": "MaxCRoser"}, {"id": "34743251", "name": "SpaceX", "username": "SpaceX"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2113699557020217528", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlwtp2vkei1xdrn4cmfrmqzc4d4t", "oldest_id": "2113394335165366734", "result_count": 25}}
